  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Moved by Paquita and Magüi, student actress Mariona pulls off her stage wig right onstage, calls out Fernando's heartlessness, and tells the director she is tired of playing maids. She urges her classmates to fight for their dreams and declares she is made for hit television like Velvet. Listen to the Spanish first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "director",
      "t": "Mariola, por favor.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "¡Déjame hablar!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Qué gusto quitarme la peluca.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Solo me pones de criada.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "No tienes corazón con lo que acabas de hacer con estas dos personas.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "¡Es inhumano!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Estoy harta de que no me escuchéis y de que no me veáis.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Estoy cansada.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Chicos, valéis mucho. De verdad, luchad por vuestros sueños.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Pasa de ellos y date tiempo.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "director",
      "t": "Hasta aquí hemos llegado.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Lo que yo iba a hacer es Velvet.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Que sepas que soy una estrella, ¿vale?",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now we walk through Mariona's big moment.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "director",
      "t": "Mariola, por favor.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mariola, please.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "¡Déjame hablar!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me speak!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Qué gusto quitarme la peluca.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a relief to take off the wig.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Solo me pones de criada.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You only ever cast me as a maid.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "No tienes corazón con lo que acabas de hacer con estas dos personas.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have no heart after what you've just done to these two people.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "¡Es inhumano!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's inhumane!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Estoy harta de que no me escuchéis y de que no me veáis.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm fed up with you all not listening to me and not seeing me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Estoy cansada.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm tired.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Chicos, valéis mucho. De verdad, luchad por vuestros sueños.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Guys, you're worth so much. Truly, fight for your dreams.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Pasa de ellos y date tiempo.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ignore them and give yourself time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "director",
      "t": "Hasta aquí hemos llegado.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is quite enough.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Lo que yo iba a hacer es Velvet.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What I was meant to do is Velvet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Que sepas que soy una estrella, ¿vale?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just so you know, I'm a star, okay?'",
      "gap": 0.9
